ming.\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1710691661230329916?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1710691661230329916?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 8th, 2023", "\"slept for 8 hours for the first time in weeks 🥹\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1711083251891376229?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1711083251891376229?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 20th, 2023", "\"⏳⏳⏳\"", "Yes", "Contains a photo", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1715581925308420310?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1715581925308420310?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 22md, 2023", "\"big news coming tomorrow.\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1716125467307020508?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1716125467307020508?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 23rd, 2023", "\"the big news:\"", "Yes", "Contains a photo", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1716467803153125379?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1716467803153125379?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 25th, 2023", "\"just wasted a week on a shitty song. onto the next!\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1717381110445838493?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1717381110445838493?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "October 26th, 2023", "\"tickets for the general on sale begin TOMORROW at 10am in your local area. get ready…\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1717611441312645550?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1717611441312645550?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "November 7th, 2023", "\"first 8 hour sleep in a week ✊\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1721936089584226637?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1721936089584226637?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "November 12th, 2023", "\"pooping whilst wearing a parka is not advisable\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1723822175675658716?