boywithukes/status/1790056118355395056?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "May 14th, 2024", "\"it’s Verlaine and Rimbaud… who is Vernon???\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1790420276741570646?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1790420276741570646?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "May 16th, 2024", "\"you guys are so fucking weird. i love it. stay fucking weird.\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1791130549265846448?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1791130549265846448?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "May 31st, 2024", "\"We’ve got @boywithukes’ new single Can You Feel It? on repeat 👏 https://spotify.link/CanYouFeelIt\"", "Yes", "Repost of Spotify USA commenting on \"Can You Feel It?\"\n\nContains a photo", {"text": "https://x.com/SpotifyUSA/status/1796625755138314263?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/SpotifyUSA/status/1796625755138314263?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "July 11th, 2024", "\"pre-save Ghost so that my team thinks that the song will blow up lol\n\nhttps://awal.ffm.to/ghost\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1811524391257407823?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1811524391257407823?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "July 21st, 2024", ":massive announcement coming August 1 with the release of Ghost.\"", "Yes", "-", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1815249569229193267?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1815249569229193267?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "July 31st, 2024", "\"boywithuke.ffm.to/boywithuke\n\nghost out now. \n\nbig announcement coming soon.\"", "Yes", "Contains a link", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1818863586065678733?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1818863586065678733?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "August 1st, 2024", "\"BoyWithUke has announced his new album, Burnout, which arrives in November.\n\nGet the exclusive scoop on his new single, “Ghost,” in the latest installment of our Origins series → http://cos.lv/CNkj50SPm6u\"", "Yes", "Repost of CONSEQUENCE's post regaring \"Burnout\"", {"text": "https://x.com/consequence/status/1819043971873546750?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/consequence/status/1819043971873546750?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "August 1st, 2024", "\"it has been 1,416 days since i started boywithuke. yet, i remember releasing my first songs with such vivid detail you’d need a politician to convince me it didn’t happen yesterday. \n\nthroughout all these years, we’ve created so many memories. so many moments. so many feelings i had never felt before.\n\nyou made me feel so spectacular. you gave me so much love. the kind of unconditional love reserved for family and for friends. you helped me become a better person. you gave me stability. you saved me. and for that i am eternally grateful. \n\nrecently however, i’ve realized that i have changed. my values, my desires, and most importantly my music. i feel like i can’t go back to the way things were, and i believe this is a good thing. i don’t want to chase what has been. i want to move forward. i want to let go.\n\nand so with great joy, i am incredibly proud to announce that my next project will be my last project as BoyWithUke.\n\nBurnout drops November.\"", "Yes", "Contains a photo\n\nFinal post on @boywithukes", {"text": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1819220526159507707?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/boywithukes/status/1819220526159507707?s=20"}], ["Twitter / X", "May 19th, 2026", "\"TELL ME ABOUT YOURSELF\"", "Yes", "First Post under @Chandol_wav account\n\nContains a video", {"text": "https://x.com/chandol_wav/status/2056783364242202717?s=20", "url": "https://x.com/chandol_wav/status/2056783364242202717?s=20"}], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", ""